document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421325005:1":{"text":"……这，这些是我们村子自己的事……","source_cn":"……这，这些是我们村子自己的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DE6AC008C9B09AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421325006:1":{"text":"好好好，你们都清楚，只瞒着我们这些外人是吧！","source_cn":"好好好，你们都清楚，只瞒着我们这些外人是吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x435FE52742403A01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421325007:1":{"text":"告诉你们！再这么放任下去，你们村子就完蛋了！！","source_cn":"告诉你们！再这么放任下去，你们村子就完蛋了！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE7B86582E89DFF98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421325008:1":{"text":"怎么会，我们的武器制造技术还——","source_cn":"怎么会，我们的武器制造技术还——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF77D95125934A8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421325009:1":{"text":"你以为还是你们拿着伪装的深岩晶，能凭着武器质量和产量说话的时候吗？！","source_cn":"你以为还是你们拿着伪装的深岩晶，能凭着武器质量和产量说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD0B143D96BDDBCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421325010:1":{"text":"